          "en": "it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 101.21000000000001,
          "end": 104.15,
          "en": "But here we have an array, so I can use it in a list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 104.15,
          "end": 107.50999999999999,
          "en": "And then all the other syntax works just the way you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 107.53999999999999,
          "end": 109.49000000000001,
          "en": "No special setup needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 109.49000000000001,
          "end": 114.22999999999999,
          "en": "This is how you can use it and this allows you to automatically subscribe here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 114.22999999999999,
          "end": 116.15,
          "en": "And the best thing is here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 116.15,
          "end": 121.79,
          "en": "Svelte will also automatically unsubscribe as soon as this component is removed from the Dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 121.79,
          "end": 125.21,
          "en": "So if I save this, we should see the exact same output as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 125.21,
          "end": 126.41,
          "en": "And we do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 126.41,
          "end": 128.81,
          "en": "But now this is all handled by svelte.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.81,
          "end": 130.67,
          "en": "And of course this is way shorter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.67,
          "end": 135.11,
          "en": "It's only one variable name which we had to change in the template in the markup here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.11,
